@{ ViewData["Title"] = "控制台"; }
<section class="dashboard-shell">
    <header class="dashboard-head"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> DEVELOPMENT CONSOLE</p><h1>開發與測試控制台</h1><p>主機負責拆分、整合及最終驗收；兩台副機僅按指定輸入執行測試，不自行選擇任務。</p></div><button id="logoutButton" class="button button-quiet">安全登出</button></header>
    <div class="dashboard-grid">
        <article class="metric-card metric-wide"><span class="micro-label">SYSTEM OVERVIEW</span><strong>先看真實成果，再看執行證據</strong><p>已授權使用者可查看主機與工作紀錄。遠端測試收據已寫入資料庫，但現有畫面仍使用 JSON 摘要，完整串接尚未完成；卡片不代表主機正在運行。</p><a class="console-link" asp-controller="Operations" asp-action="Index">開啟主機與工作歷程</a><div class="progress-track"><span></span></div></article>
        <article class="metric-card"><span class="node-status"></span><small>CORE / CODEX</small><h2>主電腦</h2><p>主要開發與任務整合</p>@if (AevryndWeb.Security.PortalIdentity.IsAdmin(User.FindFirst(System.Security.Claims.ClaimTypes.Email)?.Value ?? string.Empty)) { <a class="console-link" asp-controller="RemoteConsole" asp-action="Index">開啟安全遠端工作階段</a> }</article>
        <article class="metric-card"><span class="node-status"></span><small>ON-DEMAND TESTING</small><h2>台中</h2><p>按需 CPU／GPU 測試資源；目前已有 CPU 測試紀錄，GPU 遠端驗收尚未部署。</p></article>
        <article class="metric-card"><span class="node-status"></span><small>ON-DEMAND TESTING</small><h2>桃園</h2><p>按需 CPU／GPU 測試資源；不執行副機 Codex、Qwen 或 GitHub 任務輪詢。</p></article>
    </div>
</section>
